    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken, green chili, ginger garlic paste, salt to taste, lemon juice and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for marinating at least 15-20 minutes.",
      "In a bowl, add marinated chicken and squeeze out the moisture of the chicken.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder, curd and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add green cardamom, cumin seeds, coriander seeds, black peppercorns, salt to taste and dry roast them very well.",
      "In the same pan, add dry fenugreek leaves and roast well, transfer it into a mixer grinder jar and grind it into smooth fine powder.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi, add ghee & oil, once its hot then add onions saute it for 3-4 minutes on slow to medium flame.",
      "Once onions get translucent, add ginger garlic paste and saute it well.",
      "Add coriander powder and saute well, add degi red chili powder, curd and cook well.",
      "Add tomato puree and cook it for 4-5 minutes on medium flame.",
      "Once tomato and masala get cooked properly then add water, curd and mix it well.",
      "Add salt to taste and mix it well, add water, roasted chicken and cook it for 10-12 minutes on medium flame.",
      "Once chicken gets cooked well then add prepared masala, honey and mix it well.",
      "Switch off the flame and add butter and get dhungar for smokiness to the gravy.",
      "Serve on a serving plate and garnish it with some sprinkle prepared masala, curd, coriander sprig and butter.",
      "Serve hot with roti.",
      "Take coal and place it on a gas range that gets burned.",
      "Burn coal into a steel bowl, add cloves and butter and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a grilled pan, heat oil, place marinated chicken and roast on both sides.",
      "Once chicken gets half cooked then remove on a plate and keep it aside for further use."
    ],
